###
# Technologiya - Local API Testing
# Use with REST Client extension (VS Code)
# Install: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=humao.rest-client
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Install Rest Client extension in VS Code
# 2. Set the appropriate @baseUrl based on your environment
# 3. Click "Send Request" above each request
# 4. View responses in the right panel
###

### ============================================================================
### CONFIGURATION - Choose your environment
### ============================================================================

@localhost = http://localhost:54321
@production = https://ryehkycxyhdpufigcotc.supabase.co/functions/v1
@ngrok = https://placeholder.ngrok.io
@baseUrl = {{localhost}}

# Change @baseUrl above based on where you're testing:
# - Local: @baseUrl = {{localhost}} (needs supabase start running)
# - Production: @baseUrl = {{production}} (real endpoints)

### ============================================================================
### TEST 1: CREATE BOOKING
### ============================================================================

### 1a. Create a new booking (Standard)
POST {{baseUrl}}/create-booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "John Doe",
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "service_id": "screen-replacement",
  "location": "Mumbai, India",
  "booking_date": "2026-03-15",
  "booking_time": "14:00",
  "issue": "Cracked display screen on front"
}

###

### 1b. Create booking without email (should still work)
POST {{baseUrl}}/create-booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Jane Smith",
  "phone": "+918765432109",
  "service_id": "battery-replacement",
  "location": "Delhi",
  "booking_date": "2026-03-16",
  "booking_time": "10:00",
  "issue": "Battery drains quickly"
}

###

### 1c. Test invalid booking (missing required fields) - should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/create-booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Invalid Test"
}

###

### ============================================================================
### TEST 2: GET BOOKING STATUS
### ============================================================================

### 2a. Get booking by reference (use the short_ref from Test 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-booking-status?ref=ABC123XY

###

### 2b. Get booking by reference (another example)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-booking-status?ref=TEST001

###

### 2c. Rapid-fire requests to test rate limiting
GET {{baseUrl}}/get-booking-status?ref=ABC123XY

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/get-booking-status?ref=ABC123XY

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/get-booking-status?ref=ABC123XY

