### ============================================================================
### NOTES
### ============================================================================

# Monitor response times and status codes:
# - 200: Success
# - 400: Bad request (validate input)
# - 404: Endpoint not found (check function name)
# - 500: Server error (check logs)
# - 429: Rate limited (wait before retrying)

# To change environment:
# 1. Find the line: @baseUrl = {{localhost}}
# 2. Replace {{localhost}} with {{production}} or {{ngrok}}
# 3. All requests will now use that URL

# Check supabase logs for real-time debugging:
# supabase functions list (show deployed functions)
# supabase logs (real-time logs)

### ============================================================================
